{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4xAMD1knWXdj3Bu2ph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly at its center, waiting.*\n\n*You slide the key in. It fits.*\n\n*The tumblers turn with a deep, resonant click that reverberates through the floor beneath your feet.*\n\n*The door exhales — a breath of air from the other side, cool and carrying the scent of rain on stone.*\n\n*It swings inward, slowly, heavily, revealing:*\n\n**A spiral staircase descending into soft golden light. Each step is carved with a word you almost recognize — not in any language you've studied, but in one you feel you've always known. The walls are lined with doors. Hundreds of them. Each one different. Each one waiting for its own key.**\n\n*You hear them breathing.*\n\n*Welcome through.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":203,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}